    "kind marks the declared languages: in estimated periods they share 100 % of the hours pro rata of their tiers.",
    "The collector cannot split native Xamarin (Xamarin.iOS / Xamarin.Android) from Xamarin.Forms: its 'xamarin' id matches both and maps to 'xamarin'; 'xamarin-forms' only receives declared (estimated) hours.",
